                                                                            <comments>
                            <comment id="497518" author="JIRAUSER19474" created="Wed, 8 Jul 2026 21:54:51 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;The race occurs when:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;1. A client disconnects abruptly during flock deadlock detection&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;2. The export&apos;s refcount drops to zero from the `class_export_put()`&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;3. The zombie workqueue processes the export quickly&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;4. The original thread then accesses `bl_exp-&amp;gt;exp_flock_hash`&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
